    "Run 5 retains full-width heading layout and captures the initial sidebar as well as final tag and second-page states for each theme/scale."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "UI actions and text are tester-driven with registered TestTextInput; current Mac locked. No real IME, physical scrolling, keyboard or system-panel claim.",
